WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
I'm in a complete daze under the sun
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Guided only by my flowering love for you
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Let the flower of life bloom
Hirakeyo inochi no hana

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Let it follow its red hot desires
Akaku atsuku midasarete

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
This flame runs through the pulses
Fujouri na mirai no kodou

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Of the absurd future
Kakenukeru honoo

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.570
I feel it tingling inside me
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.070
Desire
Yokubou

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:45.780
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:50.700
And turns into great pleasure
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:56.540
I'm sure you don't know yet
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.300
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:08.260
I want to hold on to these newborn desires
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.560
More wild than soft
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.730
That will make my day
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:21.270
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.190
That I can only see for myself?
Dare ga mamoru

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:29.700
I can do it, so love me truly
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.490
<b>Yagyuu Dojo</b>

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.500
<b>The General's Powers</b>

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.130
Let's go!

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.260
Here we go, Muneakira!

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:50.010
We're going to give you...

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:51.490
...all of our qi!

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:00.020
<b>Yagyuu Shinkage Style</b>

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.940
<b>Yagyuu Shinkage Style
All the others die when a Samurai Bride is born?</b>

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:03.610
All the others die when a Samurai Bride is born?

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:04.780
That can't be!

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:08.470
It's a very risky ritual.

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:13.250
The birth of the Samurai Bride is
especially dangerous for the General.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:19.130
More than a few Generals died trying to birth a Samurai Bride.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.920
Onii-chan...

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:30.450
That might be one of the reasons why there aren't any more Generals in the shogun's family.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.680
So you want us to give up on the Samurai Bride?

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:40.100
As the slasher incidents showed,
the Dark Samurai are not unified either.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.320
If we target that weakness, we might stand a chance.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.970
Such a risky ritual is unnecessary.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.130
I can't agree to that.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:52.310
The fate of Great Japan rests on the outcome of tomorrow's battle.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.050
We need to give it our all.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.240
We can't give up without even trying!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.750
Muneakira...

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.110
You talk about trying,

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:02.830
but we still haven't decided who will become the Samurai Bride.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:07.300
That would of course be me, the warrior of love, Nao-

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.790
The grown-ups are talking.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.300
Please be quiet.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:20.440
The documents only state that "one will be chosen when the time comes."

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.690
There's only one thing we can try for now.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:28.690
That is, if my body can withstand all our qi.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:42.420
Muneakira!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.170
Oh no!

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:45.880
Everyone, stop!

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:51.350
Muneakira!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.710
Are you okay?

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:55.750
Muneakira.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.050
Muneakira-san!

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:00.330
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:01.490
But...

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.690
What?! The marks are so clear!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.900
Why didn't you say anything until now?!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.910
You can't possibly take our qi like this.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:09.610
Correct.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.290
This seal puts your very life in danger.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:15.950
So this is what Musashi talked about a month ago?

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.960
You've got one month.
That's as long as we'll wait.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.040
Bring back Yagyuu Juubei before then.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:26.080
Otherwise, you'll be unable to swing that sword for the rest of your life.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:31.130
I've never seen such a powerful seal before.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.770
This is much more dire than the matter of the Samurai Bride!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.840
R-Right.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.950
So the Samurai Bride is nothing more than a dream, an illusion.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.100
<b>Musashi</b>

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.110
No way.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.610
<b>Inshun</b>

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:54.230
So only Inshun returns.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.110
<b>Mataemon</b>

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.530
This couldn't be any more obvious.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:05.370
The only reason to have such tight security is if there's something important inside.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.670
Let's get going, okay?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:10.500
<b>Kojirou</b>

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.510
Kojirou, what are you doing here?

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:18.270
I can't let you handle this all by yourself.

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:22.060
You were about to jump into such an obvious trap.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.220
A trap?

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.730
<b>Graveyard</b>

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.110
I didn't expect you to come back.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.110
What should we do?

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:34.750
Settle things between us before dealing with the Yagyuu dojo?

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:43.130
Give this to Yagyuu Muneakira after the battle.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.500
This will release the curse?

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.840
I...

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.760
I wanted to fight properly too.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.760
They're all hopeless.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:08.350
Inshun should've been watching over you,

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:12.860
but God knows where she is,
so I came in her stead.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.930
What's up? Are we there?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.910
No.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.700
We must proceed carefully.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.490
I'll use my power.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.750
The reason my eyes didn't regenerate perfectly

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:30.320
is probably due to bad karma from my previous life.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.210
Luckily, I got these eyes instead, and they're much better.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.130
Musashi's the same.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:41.490
Her ears are artificial, so she ends up hearing things she doesn't want to.

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:45.220
That's why she blocks her ears when fighting seriously.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:49.480
So Inshun was the only one to get revived properly?

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.560
What are you saying?

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.690
She pretends to speak,

00:06:55.690 --> 00:07:00.510
but her voice comes from the small machinery on her neck.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.770
So she's mute?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.120
Now you know why she hardly speaks.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.960
That's enough idle chatter.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.450
We're here?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.300
Yeah.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.110
Are you sure this is it?

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.590
There aren't <i>any</i> guards.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:23.960
I'm certain of it.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.890
I can see through it all.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.290
Hastily set up charms.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:30.640
Hidden Master Samurai.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.650
Let's get going, okay?

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.650
I totally thought you'd go with Musashi.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.400
I'll sort things out with her in my next life.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.950
Are you awake?

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:47.290
Princess Sen...

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.540
When's the battle with the Dark Samurai?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.370
Soon.

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.800
I see.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.380
Don't worry.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.750
We're not the same as we were a month ago!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.380
We can protect you and Great Japan now!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:03.880
Okay.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.970
What are you doing, Juubei?

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.690
Why are you still in that form?

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.900
Our battle is starting soon.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.130
Yeah, but...

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.780
Did something happen?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.900
Gittan's gone.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:24.330
She's got nothing to do with this battle, after all.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:29.660
I guess she doesn't care now that the Samurai Bride is but a distant dream.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.910
I wonder if she's still angry.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.390
They're on the way.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:46.210
The Guardian Stone Shrine's main gate is under attack!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.400
75% of the Master Samurai are already down!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.680
They're already in the tunnels!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.610
The Dark Samurai, huh?

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.190
They found us.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.370
Stop, Nia.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.370
You can't do anything in that form.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.590
I know.

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:03.690
I'm just going to buy some time.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.830
Don't! You'll die.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:07.200
I don't mind.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:11.200
I was useful to a kind General like you.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.710
<b>Guardian Stone</b>

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.210
So that's the Guardian Stone?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.210
Let's get this over with.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.720
Yeah, let's break it to pieces!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.220
<b>Yagyuu Dojo</b>

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.220
<b>The Showdown</b>

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:39.770
Let's get this started.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:42.610
What? Where are your comrades?

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:45.490
I'm enough to handle the likes of you.

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:47.990
Fight me, Yagyuu Juubei!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:58.920
Did I get it?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.590
What's going on?!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.260
Don't tell me they...

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:14.610
Why does the sky look so dangerous?

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.730
This is bad!

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.610
The land's qi is in chaos!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.230
Is it the Guardian Stone?

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:21.050
Musashi!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.150
You tricked us!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.870
You vowed to come fight us,

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.030
yet you sent your comrades to the Guardian Stone!

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.780
No, look at her.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:34.540
She had no idea what her comrades were doing.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:35.790
What the hell?

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:45.270
Our fate's destined to be used by others, anyway!

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:49.930
Hoping for a nice future after getting revived was just a dream, huh?

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.430
Say, Yagyuu Juubei!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.430
Miyamoto Musashi.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.770
0.1 mm shear found on the Guardian Stone.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.470
The qi around the archipelago is in chaos!

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.330
Don't panic! It's just temporary.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.940
Hurry and restore the barrier!

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.450
The Guardian Stone's still fine.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.450
You can release your curse with this.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.950
So you want to give up on the battle?

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.470
Are you all right with that, Musashi?

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:28.800
Didn't you come here to fight me?!

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.600
Of course I'm not all right with it!

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:38.070
Such overwhelming qi!

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:40.450
I thought she gave up!

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.810
It's because Juubei couldn't keep her mouth shut!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:51.030
That's much better!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.530
<b>The Previous Day</b>

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:53.570
<b>Yagyuu Shinkage Style
I wonder why it's the four of them.</b>

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:56.160
<b>Yagyuu Shinkage Style
I wonder why it's the four of them.</b>

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:59.950
I don't think they were chosen simply based on their power.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:05.070
It must be their attachments to, and regrets about, this world.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.670
That might be it.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:12.490
I wish I could cut them down, together with those chains.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.430
Is that it, Juubei?!

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.330
Stop it, Juubei!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.710
We don't have time for this!

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:32.550
I'll take care of this.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:33.870
You guys head to the Guardian Stone!

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:34.870
Muneakira!

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:36.330
Understood! Let's go!

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.620
Is <i>that</i> all the damage it took?!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.830
We have to shatter it to pieces!

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.500
I hear ya!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.070
What do ya think you're doing?

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:54.760
Get away from there, Inshun.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.730
Inshun, we were revived...

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:09.190
...to destroy this stone!

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.490
She's strong.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:16.280
I didn't know she was this strong.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.170
Take this!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:24.540
Did I get her?

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.210
Not just yet!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:42.370
You are to leave!

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:44.170
She's still alive?!

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.150
Mataemon!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.230
Huh?

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:48.730
Time to use our trump card.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.730
Fight with everything.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.210
Destroy everything.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:00.990
Crap.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.910
Why are they fighting each other?

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:12.540
<i>I</i> am your opponent!

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:23.090
Has she always been this tough?

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.510
Or have we just gotten weaker?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:40.650
All you who detest the current peace of Great Japan.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.250
Give me your strength!

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.080
Are you okay, Juubei?!

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:51.470
The fun's only just begun.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.090
Right, Miyamoto Musashi?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:55.090
You've got that right!

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:09.430
Kill! Kill them all!

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:12.130
I'll give you the power!

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:14.440
Spread war and chaos!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.230
Mataemon!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:17.510
What?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.650
This is it for you!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.250
Yagyuu Gisen?

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:29.250
I couldn't show you the other day,

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.810
but this is my magic eye!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.730
What on Earth was that light?

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.260
They got away.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:45.090
Apparently so.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.850
The Dark Samurai ran away?

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:50.680
I thought their goal was to destroy the Guardian Stone.

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:55.980
Perhaps they sensed me approaching and ran away in fear.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:57.450
Not a chance.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:03.490
They probably noticed that the barrier is recovering.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.230
There's no doubt about it.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:09.370
The barrier's strength is returning.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:15.500
That would be why we could barely even scratch the Guardian Stone.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:19.660
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.010
Barrier recovery at 99.9%.
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:22.830
Barrier recovery at 99.9%.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.870
We're far ahead of schedule!

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:27.690
Only one hour left until recovery is complete!

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:28.760
Very good.

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:34.270
Once the barrier's mended, the wraiths won't be able to make another move.

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:36.110
Looks like I win this one.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:43.510
Do not disturb my duel with Juubei!

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:45.830
Who cares about duels?

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:49.830
You were revived to dispose of the Master Samurai.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.930
Now, burn the charm that can undo the curse!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.660
Stop!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.290
What the...

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.320
Now the General will die!

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:03.800
Onii-chan!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:07.830
Once the General dies, the Master Samurai will lose their power.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:10.910
No one can stand in our way now.

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:15.310
Oh no. I'm out of time.

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:16.310
Onii-chan!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:20.950
I just want to have a good duel with Juubei!

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:22.610
Properly, as samurai!

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:26.510
If I can't have that, I'm gonna kill myself!

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:26.990
What?!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:27.740
Mucchan!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.160
Maedake-san!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.040
Keiji!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:36.210
That'd be pointless too.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.990
Hey, wraiths!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.420
Stop hiding and show yourselves!

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:45.130
Maeda Keiji.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:50.430
Now that the Master Samurai are certain to disappear, you are the only threat remaining.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:52.150
You will die!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:55.750
Is that supposed to be a joke?

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:56.940
Hey, Muneakira.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:01.950
Show them that the Master Samurai and their General are all right!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.150
B-But...

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:06.650
Just blow the seal away with qi!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:08.250
Give it a try!

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.750
It should be easy for you!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.450
I-I see.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.130
Impudent!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:23.670
What?!

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:25.170
Whoa, Onii-chan!

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:36.410
You did it, Onii-chan!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.810
You sure are something if you can blow it away with just your qi.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.480
Wh-What's with this weird flow of qi?

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:47.830
I'm so glad! Your hands are fine now!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.300
Yeah, I'm all right now!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.240
This is bad, Muneakira!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:55.910
Some great and evil qi is about to move.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.490
The time has come.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.730
All you restless souls.

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:04.750
Gather in the vessel and claim your revenge!

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:15.260
Kill! Kill! Kill!

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:21.650
Wh-What the...

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:25.630
Was this Inshun's role?

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.750
She's a spirit vessel.

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:28.790
A spirit vessel?

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.650
When the time comes, you'll know.

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:37.250
Please... kill... me.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:39.370
Juubei!

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:47.000
Dark Samurai... give me your power!

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:51.870
Mucchan, are you okay?

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.310
Get a hold of yourself!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.100
Are you okay, Musashi?

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.100
Ouch!

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.010
Watch out!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.310
Get away from her, both of you!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.890
Mucchan!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.810
What on Earth <i>is</i> that giant monster?!

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.590
Its battle potential is otherworldly.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:33.170
It wants to break through the barrier!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.010
The barrier has almost completely recovered by now.

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:38.810
We need to hold it back until it's done!

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:40.640
Everyone, dodge it!

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:45.440
Adamant Shield!

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:53.650
I... can't hold this for much longer!

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.850
Frozen Blade!

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.330
Absolute Zero!

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:15.880
What <i>is</i> that lump of evil qi?

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:20.720
The smallest of the Dark Samurai is at its core.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:22.220
Inko-chan!

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:27.030
It seems the evil qi is using her as a spirit vessel.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:32.750
No way!

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:14.090
Onii-chan, Yukki, Beta-san,

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:17.670
Princess Sen, Hanzou-san, Gutsugutsu-san,

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:20.590
Gittan, Sacchin, Maedake-san,

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:22.770
Nia-san, Yoshihiko-sama,

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:26.010
Mucchan, Kojirou-san, and Mataemon-san.

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:28.540
Lastly, Inko-chan.

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:32.410
I'm really happy I could meet you all.

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:36.740
Whatever the end may be, I have no regrets.

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:39.990
Final episode: Birth of the Samurai Bride
